WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.488
Next, check the reader's scopes
against the workflow task.

2
00:00:03.488 --> 00:00:07.262
The workflow scope is missing
and both read scopes are extra:

3
00:00:07.262 --> 00:00:10.962
the comparison fails in both
directions, which is the point.

4
00:00:10.962 --> 00:00:12.863
Two jobs need two clients.

5
00:00:12.863 --> 00:00:14.763
Then the Graph app registration.

6
00:00:14.763 --> 00:00:19.514
Holding only the user read permission, it
fails a drift run that reads the audit,

7
00:00:19.514 --> 00:00:21.999
because the audit permission is missing.

8
00:00:21.999 --> 00:00:23.875
With the required-only option,

9
00:00:23.875 --> 00:00:27.840
the same grant passes for a drift
run that doesn't read the audit.
